{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    with add to cart button will be position as right bottom corner of the plant product
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;padding:36px;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};border-radius:22px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#14231a}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before{content:'';position:absolute;right:-8%;top:-55%;width:55%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-conic-gradient(rgba(255,214,10,.13) 0 8deg,transparent 8deg 20deg),radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,10,.2),transparent 68%)}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{position:relative;z-index:1}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0 0 24px;color:#1f5130;font:clamp(25px,3vw,38px)/1.15 Georgia,serif}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 4px 12px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);min-width:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;scroll-snap-align:start;border-radius:16px;background:var(--card-bg);box-shadow:0 5px 18px #1b372314;transition:transform .24s,box-shadow .24s}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #1b372626}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/.88;overflow:hidden;background:#f0eee5}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .35s}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img{transform:scale(1.025)}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{height:100%;position:relative}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;color:#73836f}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;right:8px;padding:6px;background:#ffffffed;color:#39443c;text-align:center;font-size:11px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:12px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__best{left:12px;color:#fff;background:#1f5130}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount{right:12px;color:#14231a;background:#ffd60a}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{position:relative;display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;padding:15px 15px 58px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{align-self:flex-start;margin-bottom:9px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:#f1f5e9;color:#244c2e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{margin:0 0 5px;color:#1f5130;font:clamp(17px,1.7vw,21px)/1.2 Georgia,serif}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{margin:0;color:#5b6660;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__prices{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{color:#1f5130;font-size:18px;font-weight:750}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{color:#5b6660;font-size:12px;text-decoration:line-through}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;background:#1f5130;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:hover{transform:scale(1.06);background:#0d3a1d}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:focus-visible,.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9b7400;outline-offset:3px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart svg{width:19px;height:19px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{position:absolute;top:44%;z-index:2;width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid #1f513033;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#1f5130;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px #192d1d22;cursor:pointer}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev{left:-12px;opacity:.82}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next{right:-12px;color:#fff;background:#1f5130}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg{width:19px;height:19px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status{margin:8px 4px 0;color:#39443c;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:989px){.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:28px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:22px 15px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before{width:75%;right:-32%;top:-35%}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:84%}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{gap:13px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:38px;height:38px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev{left:-8px}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next{right:-8px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{scroll-behavior:auto}.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card,.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img,.ai-plant-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{transition:none}}
